"toegevoegd wanneer één GPU geen aangesloten beeldscherm heeft.\n"
"\n"
"Schakel dit alleen uit als de automatische oplossing problemen "
"veroorzaakt.Opnieuw opstarten vereist."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:243
msgid ""
"Disables GPU VSync.\n"
"May reduce latency, but can increase power usage and tearing."
msgstr ""
"Schakelt GPU VSync uit.\n"
"Kan de latentie verminderen, maar kan het stroomverbruik en de tearing "
"verhogen."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:249
msgid ""
"Forces software rendering.\n"
"Use only in case of graphical issues.\n"
"May significantly reduce performance."
msgstr ""
"Forceert softwarerendering.\n"
"Alleen gebruiken bij grafische problemen.\n"
"Kan de prestaties aanzienlijk verminderen."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:256
msgid ""
"Avoids GPU-backed video frame buffers.\n"
"May help with black screens, flickering, and GPU crashes.\n"
"Restart required."
msgstr ""

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:263
msgid ""
"Disables zero-copy GPU buffer transfers.\n"
"May improve compatibility with some graphics drivers.\n"
"Restart required."
msgstr ""

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:270
msgid ""
"Disables hardware video decoding without disabling all GPU acceleration.\n"
"Use when videos play only audio, appear white or black, flicker, or cause "
"crashes.\n"
"May increase CPU and battery usage. Restart required."
msgstr ""
